        "text_intro": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This spicy green salmon crudo is an easy way to make a weeknight meal feel a little more special without spending hours in the kitchen. Silky slices of our King Salmon sit on a creamy avocado-lime dressing, with Fresno chile, green onion and a drizzle of salsa macha on top.</p><p>There is no stove involved. Blend the dressing, slice the salmon, plate it, and it is on the table in about 15 minutes &mdash; bright, a little fiery, and the kind of dish that looks like it came from a restaurant.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
